# Deny everything; allow only tracked config. Each config/ subdir owns its
# own allowlist in this format (deny all, then re-include specifics).
# See config/.gitignore.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE.xdg-ninja
!upstream.json
!json-schema/
!json-schema/**
!programs/
!programs/**
!programs-local/
!programs-local/**

# The generated reverse/enriched index is a cache: denied by * above and never
# re-included, so it stays untracked.
